# pnpm workspace: pnpm-lock.yaml is the ONLY lockfile. A root package-lock.json
# or yarn.lock makes EAS Build (and anyone else) detect the wrong package
# manager — `npm ci` then installs ~28 root packages and none of the workspace,
# and the Android build dies at "The expo package was not found". Happened on
# 22 Aug 2026 after an `npm install` for the EC2 SSM scripts. Sub-projects that
# genuinely use npm (towing-aws-infra/) keep their own lockfile; only the root
# is guarded.
/package-lock.json
/yarn.lock

apps/towgo/google-services.json
apps/towgo/google-plist.json
